[7AM] #LagIbdExpWay
#3MB
#TrafficUpdate

As expected on Saturday morning, Traffic is unhindered moving inward Secretariat from Berger.

Approaching Tollgate is a bit steady due to vehicles making Utun at the Turning.
The rest of the journey down to Iyana Oworo is free.
Inward and outward of the Third mainland bridge is also free.

The return journey from Iyana Oworo back to Tollgate and Berger is free.
Do not overspeed.
Speed kills!
